{"title":"Halloweenly","slug":"Halloweenly","hero":{"file":"HalloweenlyTree.webp","width":111,"height":93},"pageid":4523,"revid":20203,"timestamp":"2025-10-19T18:04:34Z","lastEditor":"Kor4d 0999","categories":[],"infobox":{"type":"Wood","fields":[{"label":"Island","value":"Any"},{"label":"Log","value":"??"},{"label":"Sanded","value":"~$110/stud"},{"label":"Version Added","value":"v1.93.1"},{"label":"Date Added","value":"4/10/2025"},{"label":"Status","value":"Obtainable"},{"label":"Planked","value":"~$137.5/stud"}]},"sections":[{"id":"description","text":"Description"},{"id":"trivia","text":"Trivia"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"description\">Description</h2>\n<p>The <b>Halloweenly</b> Tree is a large purple tree that has light rays emitting from the leaves and the log emitting a glow.\n</p><p>It is an event tree which spawns randomly during <b>Saturday</b>s. (starts every midnight, EST) When finding this, It is recommended to use a <b><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/UFO/\">UFO</a></b> and fly to the <b><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Heavenly_Shrine/\">Heavenly Shrine</a></b> at <b><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Snowy_Peaks/\">Snowy Peaks</a></b>. If a pedestal lights up with a purple light, that means there is a <b>Halloweenly</b> Tree in the direction of the pedestal. It can spawn in unusual places such as on the edges of something, and in unreachable places.\n</p>\n<h2 id=\"trivia\">Trivia</h2>\n<p><b>Halloweenly</b> Tree spawns with a lot of <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Bomb_fruit/\">Bomb fruits</a>, so make sure to get rid of them, otherwise they will explode after cutting the tree and it will probably get flung.\n</p>\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: this is probably the time where it has a chance to spawn\">this is probably the time where it has a chance to spawn</span> \t<noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: this is probably the time where it has a chance to spawn\">this is probably the time where it has a chance to spawn</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p>this is probably the time where it has a chance to spawn</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: this is a picture of it next to a  heavenly tree (sry it cant do much im new :P)\">this is a picture of it next to a  heavenly tree (sry it cant do much im new :P)</span> \t<noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: this is a picture of it next to a  heavenly tree (sry it cant do much im new :P)\">this is a picture of it next to a  heavenly tree (sry it cant do much im new :P)</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p>this is a picture of it next to a  heavenly tree (sry it cant do much im new :P)</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>(please edit the volume cost)\n</p>"}
